# A baseline screenshot of a story (pnpm visual:update). Git must not
# change its line endings or show it as a text diff.
*.screenshot.png binary

# Office and PDF test files of the file converter (CTX-1433). Git must not
# show them as a text diff: a PDF can look like text but hold other bytes.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
